<title>USA: U.S. Congress adjourns for the year.</title>
<headline>U.S. Congress adjourns for the year.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 104th session of the U.S. Congress ended on Friday when the House of Representatives adjourned for the year.</p>
<p>The Senate adjourned on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 105th session of Congress is scheduled to begin next January 7 when representatives and senators to be elected in November are sworn in.</p>
